{
  "info": {
    "name": "Water Delivery API - Commission",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Water Delivery Platform including Phase 1 core features, Phase 1.5 enhanced features, Phase 2 security enhancements, and Phase 3 infrastructure endpoints.\n\n**Phase 1 Features:**\n- Authentication & Authorization\n- Admin Management\n- Product Moderation\n- Order Management\n- Refund Management\n- Dispute Management\n- Escalation Management\n- Vendor Products\n- Store Management\n- Product Discovery\n- Customer Management - Commission Management (admin commission rules and calculations) - Subscription Management (customer recurring delivery subscriptions) - Wallet Management (customer wallet operations and balance management) - Vendor Store Management (comprehensive vendor store operations)\n\n**Phase 2 Security Enhancements:**\n- Rider Authentication (OTP-based login, JWT tokens)\n- Task Management (accept, pickup, deliver, fail)\n- Shift Management (shift end, cash reconciliation)\n- Notifications & Support (notification history, support tickets)\n- Security Features (rate limiting, session management)\n\n**Phase 3 Infrastructure:**\n- Background Worker Status (worker monitoring, queue metrics)\n- Cache Management (cache statistics, invalidation)\n- Offline Support (connectivity monitoring, sync status)\n- System Monitoring (health checks, performance metrics)\n\n**Security Features:**\n- JWT-based authentication for all protected endpoints\n- Rate limiting on authentication endpoints\n- Session management with automatic expiration\n- Role-based access control (Admin, Vendor, Customer, Rider)\n- Input validation and sanitization\n- Error response standardization\n\n**Environment Variables:**\n- baseUrl: Base URL for the API server\n- adminToken: JWT token for admin operations\n- vendorToken: JWT token for vendor operations\n- customerToken: JWT token for customer operations\n- riderToken: JWT token for rider operations",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4242",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "vendorToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT token for authenticated vendor requests"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT token for authenticated admin requests"
    },
    {
      "key": "customerToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT token for authenticated customer requests"
    },
    {
      "key": "riderToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT token for authenticated rider requests"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{riderToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// This script runs before every request",
          "// You can add common setup logic here",
          "console.log('Making request to: ' + pm.request.url.toString());"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// This script runs after every request",
          "// You can add common test logic here",
          "console.log('Request completed with status: ' + pm.response.code);",
          "",
          "// Check for common error responses",
          "if (pm.response.code >= 400) {",
          "    console.log('Error response:', pm.response.json());",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Commission Management",
      "description": "Admin endpoints for commission rule management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Commission Rules",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/commissions/rules?scope=GLOBAL&isActive=true",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "commissions",
                "rules"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "scope",
                  "value": "GLOBAL",
                  "description": "Filter by commission scope (GLOBAL, CATEGORY, VENDOR, PRODUCT)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "isActive",
                  "value": "true",
                  "description": "Filter by active status"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get commission rules with optional scope and active status filters",
            "event": [
              {
                "listen": "test",
                "script": {
                  "exec": [
                    "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                    "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                    "});",
                    "",
                    "pm.test(\"Response is array of commission rules\", function () {",
                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('array');",
                    "    if (jsonData.length > 0) {",
                    "        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('id');",
                    "        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('scope');",
                    "        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('percentage');",
                    "        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('isActive');",
                    "    }",
                    "});"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Commission Rule",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"scope\": \"GLOBAL\",\n  \"percentage\": 5.0,\n  \"priority\": 1,\n  \"isActive\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/commissions/rules",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "commissions",
                "rules"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Create a new commission rule",
            "event": [
              {
                "listen": "test",
                "script": {
                  "exec": [
                    "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                    "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                    "});",
                    "",
                    "pm.test(\"Response has commission rule fields\", function () {",
                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('id');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('scope');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('percentage');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('priority');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('isActive');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('createdBy');",
                    "});"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Commission Rule by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/commissions/rules/:ruleId",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "commissions",
                "rules",
                ":ruleId"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "ruleId",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get a specific commission rule by ID",
            "event": [
              {
                "listen": "test",
                "script": {
                  "exec": [
                    "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                    "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                    "});",
                    "",
                    "pm.test(\"Response has commission rule fields\", function () {",
                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('id');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('scope');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('percentage');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('priority');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('isActive');",
                    "});"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Commission Rule",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"percentage\": 7.5,\n  \"priority\": 2,\n  \"isActive\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/commissions/rules/:ruleId",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "commissions",
                "rules",
                ":ruleId"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "ruleId",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Update a specific commission rule",
            "event": [
              {
                "listen": "test",
                "script": {
                  "exec": [
                    "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                    "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                    "});",
                    "",
                    "pm.test(\"Response has updated commission rule\", function () {",
                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('id');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('percentage');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('priority');",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('isActive');",
                    "});"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Commission Rule",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/commissions/rules/:ruleId",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "commissions",
                "rules",
                ":ruleId"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "ruleId",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Delete a specific commission rule",
            "event": [
              {
                "listen": "test",
                "script": {
                  "exec": [
                    "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                    "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                    "});",
                    "",
                    "pm.test(\"Response has success message\", function () {",
                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                    "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                    "});"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}